namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel
    src   "The native base for the ControlsGallery showcase .dui: one handler per input-control family,\nevery one of them appending to a short event log a binding displays live. The gallery's job is\nINPUT coverage -- click, toggle, drag, scroll, text, selection -- so what the class provides is\nobservation: every interaction leaves a line, and a walkthrough (or a human) reads the panel\nitself to see what fired."
    text  "ControlsGallery 展示 .dui 的原生基类：每类输入控件对应一个处理程序，\n每个处理程序都向一份简短的事件日志追加记录，并由某个绑定实时显示。该展示面板的职责是\n覆盖输入——点击、切换、拖动、滚动、文本、选择——因此该类提供的是\n观察能力：每次交互都会留下一行记录，走查（或人工）读取面板本身，\n即可看到触发了什么。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:bGalleryToggle {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:bGalleryToggle
    src   "The `<->` target of the gallery's main toggle."
    text  "展示面板主开关的 `<->` 目标。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:GetEventLogText {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:GetEventLogText
    src   "The last few events, newest first, one string a Text binding shows."
    text  "最近几条事件，最新的在前，由 Text 绑定显示为一个字符串。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:LogEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:LogEvent
    src   "Appends one line, newest first, keeping the log short."
    text  "追加一行，最新的在前，并保持日志简短。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:OnGalleryWheelPick {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIControlsGalleryPanel:OnGalleryWheelPick
    src   "The ring menu's commit. Logs the TAG, which is the whole point of an item carrying one."
    text  "环形菜单的提交。会记录 TAG，而条目携带 TAG 的全部意义就在于此。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIShowcaseDialog {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIShowcaseDialog
    src   "What the showcase's 弹窗 button opens: Native.Dialog with the demo's words already in it.\n\nA CLASS rather than a configured instance because that is the shape ShowModal takes -- the\nsubsystem instantiates the class itself, so anything a dialog is supposed to say has to be part of\nwhat the class IS. Three lines of constructor defaults are the whole subclass; everything else,\nincluding which result each button answers with, is UDreamDialog's."
    text  "展示面板的弹窗按钮所打开的内容：Native.Dialog，其中已填入演示的文案。\n\n之所以是类而不是配置好的实例，是因为 ShowModal 采用的就是这种形式——子系统自己\n实例化该类，因此对话框要说的任何内容都必须属于该类本身。整个子类\n只有三行构造函数默认值；其余一切，包括每个按钮返回哪个结果，\n都来自 UDreamDialog。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIShowcasePanel {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIShowcasePanel
    src   "The native base for the MediaConsole showcase .dui: every variable and function that file binds\nagainst, in one place a Blueprint can parent. It exists so the language demo exercises real\nbindings -- `<->` onto bMuted, expressions over IsMuted()/GetFade(), `each` over both a variable\n(Tracks) and a function (GetHistory()) -- without asking the author to first build a data model\nin Blueprint."
    text  "MediaConsole 展示 .dui 的原生基类：该文件所绑定的所有变量和函数\n都集中在一处，蓝图可以以此为父类。它的存在是为了让语言演示练习真实\n绑定——对 bMuted 使用 `<->`、对 IsMuted()/GetFade() 使用表达式、对变量\n(Tracks) 和函数 (GetHistory()) 都使用 `each`——而无需让作者先在蓝图中\n构建数据模型。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIShowcasePanel:bMuted {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIShowcasePanel:bMuted
    src   "The `<->` target of the mute toggle: the toggle writes here, code writes move the toggle."
    text  "静音开关的 `<->` 目标：开关写入这里，代码写入时开关随之移动。"
