DreamUIShowcasePanel:ModalDialogClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIShowcasePanel:ModalDialogClass
    src   "What HandleOpenModal shows. Defaults to UDreamUIShowcaseDialog, which is the only reason the\ngallery's 弹窗 button does anything: it was a TSubclassOf nobody ever filled in, so the click\nreached the subsystem, found no class, logged a line and stopped. Still overridable -- unset,\nthe click logs instead of opening nothing."
    text  "HandleOpenModal 显示的内容。默认为 UDreamUIShowcaseDialog，这也是画廊的弹窗\n按钮唯一能起作用的原因：它原本是一个从未被填过的 TSubclassOf，因此点击\n到达子系统后找不到类，记录一行日志便停止了。仍可覆盖——未设置时，\n点击只会记录日志，而不是什么也不打开。"
    state machine
}

