DreamUIShowcaseTrack {
    at    Source/DreamGUISamples/Public/Demo/DreamUIShowcase.h#DreamUIShowcaseTrack
    src   "One row of showcase data: the object shape `each` iterates. Members are read by name through\nreflection (FDreamUIEachAdapter), so what a .dui writes as `Track.Title` is literally this\nUPROPERTY. `Label` doubles as the member the history list shows -- one item class for both\nlists keeps the demo's data model in one place."
    text  "展示数据的一行：`each` 迭代的对象结构。成员通过反射（FDreamUIEachAdapter）按名称读取，\n因此 .dui 中写的 `Track.Title` 实际上就是这个\nUPROPERTY。`Label` 同时充当历史记录列表所显示的成员——两个列表共用一个项类，\n使演示的数据模型集中在一处。"
    state machine
}

